        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2017 Atlantic 10 Men's Basketball Tournament\n- Places: Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania\n- Venues: PPG Paints Arena\n- Organizations: Pittsburgh Penguins, National Hockey League, Pittsburgh Power, Arena Football League\n\nFacts:\n- The 2017 Atlantic 10 Men's Basketball Tournament was scheduled to be held on March 8–12, 2017 at PPG Paints Arena in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania.\n- PPG Paints Arena is a multi-purpose indoor arena in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania.\n- From 2011 to 2014, PPG Paints Arena was the home of the Pittsburgh Power of the Arena Football League.\n- PPG Paints Arena serves as the home of the Pittsburgh Penguins of the National Hockey League.",
